# Hashtag Web3 — AI Agent & Cursor Rules
# https://hashtagweb3.com

- Follow Next.js 14 App Router conventions.
- Maintain full compatibility with AI agent standards (llms.txt, acceptmarkdown, OpenAPI 3.1, RFC 9727 API Catalog, WorkOS auth.md, MCP Streamable-HTTP).
- All API routes under /api/* must return structured JSON error envelopes with { error: { code, message, hint, docUrl } }.
- Serve text/markdown with proper YAML frontmatter (title, description, canonical, last-updated).
- Keep all UI and styling clean, responsive, and untouched unless explicitly requested.
- Ensure RFC RateLimit headers (RateLimit-Limit, RateLimit-Remaining, RateLimit-Reset) are preserved on all API routes.
